    "detailed_description": "<h1>Join Discor</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1989960/extras/df3f7e9bab01e3125c5fca71aa642f60.poster.avif?t=1747999816\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1989960/extras/df3f7e9bab01e3125c5fca71aa642f60.webm?t=1747999816\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A precision platformer, where you fly and collect stars.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">What you can expect if you buy:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">68+1 solo levels</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">3-5 hours of gameplay - every level takes 1-2 minutes if you don't die. But you will...</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Increasing difficulty, a fair difficulty curve was the goal, sometimes the game can be hard, sorry for that...</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Multiplayer shooting - a friendly fight with your people never hurts</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Multiplayer time trial - speedrunning the levels online (Trackmania style)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">4 different biomes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">All handmade graphics and sound - no AI</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1989960/extras/b39a9689858f616ea656752233a4fb21.poster.avif?t=1747999816\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1989960/extras/b39a9689858f616ea656752233a4fb21.webm?t=1747999816\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1989960/extras/b39a9689858f616ea656752233a4fb21.mp4?t=1747999816\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1989960/extras/b728943a5019cc982a50e921b2ad6cf4.poster.avif?t=1747999816\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1989960/extras/b728943a5019cc982a50e921b2ad6cf4.webm?t=1747999816\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1989960/extras/b728943a5019cc982a50e921b2ad6cf4.mp4?t=1747999816\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>In single player mode the level difficulty increases slowly, giving plenty of time to enjoy and learn the challenging mechanics of flying between the platforms. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1989960/extras/61879af6c44b0f50b6ed0f5a9230fc60.poster.avif?t=1747999816\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1989960/extras/61879af6c44b0f50b6ed0f5a9230fc60.webm?t=1747999816\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1989960/extras/61879af6c44b0f50b6ed0f5a9230fc60.mp4?t=1747999816\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1989960/extras/e4b7bee418574df4be6e45d4aef2cef0.poster.avif?t=1747999816\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1989960/extras/e4b7bee418574df4be6e45d4aef2cef0.webm?t=1747999816\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1989960/extras/e4b7bee418574df4be6e45d4aef2cef0.mp4?t=1747999816\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>You can go one step further and aim for speed! This game is especially designed for speedrunning, an homage to the style was deeply my intention. Playing against your own time, or against the Global Leaderboards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1989960/extras/acf6c6df3fb7d30450400f82259720a6.poster.avif?t=1747999816\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1989960/extras/acf6c6df3fb7d30450400f82259720a6.webm?t=1747999816\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1989960/extras/acf6c6df3fb7d30450400f82259720a6.mp4?t=1747999816\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>Challenge each other in online TimeTrials. Playing on the same level racing for the best time. Highly inspired by TrackMania Nations. A very fun mode with a high pressure sharp skill challenge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1989960/extras/d73797949ea8a9ba491cb574120046de.poster.avif?t=1747999816\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1989960/extras/d73797949ea8a9ba491cb574120046de.webm?t=1747999816\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1989960/extras/d73797949ea8a9ba491cb574120046de.mp4?t=1747999816\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1989960/extras/cde291775405b38cc52166695d264a15.poster.avif?t=1747999816\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1989960/extras/cde291775405b38cc52166695d264a15.webm?t=1747999816\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1989960/extras/cde291775405b38cc52166695d264a15.mp4?t=1747999816\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>Let's Kill each other! Online, high speed, fast paced, tactical good old shooting! Head-On: The Ultimate Gravity Shooter is considered the predecessor of this game. Try that online was the ultimate goal! Hope you enjoy that mode, it is my favourite.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1989960/extras/75ac3b30a00023ea7d58aa8e0cb42524.poster.avif?t=1747999816\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1989960/extras/75ac3b30a00023ea7d58aa8e0cb42524.webm?t=1747999816\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1989960/extras/75ac3b30a00023ea7d58aa8e0cb42524.mp4?t=1747999816\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1989960/extras/c3377f00d7d39d7405393e3e10e8e22b.poster.avif?t=1747999816\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1989960/extras/c3377f00d7d39d7405393e3e10e8e22b.webm?t=1747999816\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1989960/extras/c3377f00d7d39d7405393e3e10e8e22b.mp4?t=1747999816\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1989960/extras/d134d9c90385a8f6c7913272281f9d14.poster.avif?t=1747999816\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1989960/extras/d134d9c90385a8f6c7913272281f9d14.webm?t=1747999816\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1989960/extras/d134d9c90385a8f6c7913272281f9d14.mp4?t=1747999816\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>Choose the skin of your ship, choose your trail, your weapons! Fine tune the engine, even the nitty-gritty details can be set to your taste. To perform on the highest level, you might need those.</p>",
